ок экрана · Мамавиолэтчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/14/Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-45-48-220.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180929155221"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-49-32-217.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/81/Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-49-32-217.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20180929155304","caption":"Снимок экрана · Мамавиолэтчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/81/Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-49-32-217.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180929155304"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-50-17-066.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/ce/Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-50-17-066.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20180929155320","caption":"Снимок экрана · Мамавиолэтчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/ce/Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-50-17-066.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180929155320"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-50-49-360.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e1/Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-50-49-360.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20180929155919","caption":"Снимок экрана · Мамавиолэтчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e1/Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-50-49-360.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180929155919"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-51-15-568.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/43/Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-51-15-568.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220816020803","caption":"Снимок экрана · Мамавиолэтчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/43/Bandicam_2018-09-29_11-51-15-568.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220816020803"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/9e/9ebe0331fd66bc37418f.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:0075.jpg",