=20140701022146","caption":"Из альбома «Мамавиолэтчи» · № 31","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/df/Hanatarezotchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20140701022146"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-connection-version-5-dfb1d2","title":"Tamagotchi Connection Version 5","ru":"Tamagotchi Connection Version 5","kind":"device","note":""},{"id":"tamagotchi-on-24dbc2","title":"Tamagotchi On","ru":"Tamagotchi On","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-uni-52d523","title":"Tamagotchi Uni","ru":"Tamagotchi Uni","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-m-x-e0c3cb","title":"Tamagotchi m!x","ru":"Tamagotchi m!x","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"}]}